  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/antonmedv/fx/tarball/40.0.2",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/antonmedv/fx/zipball/40.0.2",
  "body": "## Fixes\n\n- A `__proto__` key in JSON input is now kept as a regular field instead of being dropped, and `walk` and `sortKeys` keep it too (#449). Thanks @anishpentyala for the report!\n- `groupBy` no longer drops items whose group is `__proto__` (#448). Thanks @yuxino!\n- Block comments ending in `**/` now close correctly (#445). Thanks @HoneyPaptan!\n- `zip()` with no inputs returns `[]` instead of looping forever (#442). Thanks @nk-batman21!\n- Errors in YAML, TOML or XML input are printed to stderr instead of stdout (#441). Thanks @jdotc1!\n- Arrays with holes keep their indexes in output: `[1, , 3]` prints as `[1,null,3]` (#443). Thanks @nk-batman21!\n",
